Orion Nebula
from Argus by gke0op (Ekmel Ozdemir)

Credit
  Argus, https://github.com/gke0op/argus (owner gke0op, copyright holder Ekmel Ozdemir).
  The shader's own header names Claude Opus (Anthropic) as its author, dated 2026-10-16. The
  repository's NOTICE.md says themes/Orion_Nebula.metal and its data file were written by Claude
  Opus, that Ekmel Ozdemir directed the project and holds the copyright, and that the baking tool is
  tools/orion_bake/bake.py.

